# Generated native + packaged build artifacts (regenerated from committed config).
# The SOURCE OF TRUTH for the desktop/mobile shells is:
#   - electron/main.cjs + electron/preload.cjs   (committed)
#   - capacitor.config.json                       (committed)
#   - package.json "build" + cap/electron scripts (committed)
# The dirs below are produced by `cap add android|ios`, `cap sync`, and
# `npm run electron:build` — large, reproducible, and must not be committed
# (dist_electron alone holds a ~180MB PRISM.exe + ~373MB app.asar).

# electron-builder output (electron:build --dir)
/dist_electron/

# Capacitor generated native projects (regenerate: cap add android|ios; cap sync)
/android/
/ios/

# Build / test scratch logs written during verification runs
/electron-build*.log
/cap-add-*.log
/cap-sync-*.log
/e2e-stdout.log
/e2e-result.json

# Playwright run artifacts (regenerated every `playwright test`)
/test-results/
/tmp-playwright/
/vitest-*-output.txt

# Stray scratch dirs (env-var that failed to expand on Windows; scratch sandbox)
/%TEMP%/
/.quebec/
